# .claudeignore
# Designed to prevent sensitive data, proprietary models/datasets, and noise from being uploaded to AI agents with data retention.

# 1. Secrets & Credentials (PREVENT LEAKS)
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.crt
*secret*.json
*credential*.json
service-account*.json
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets/
credentials/
auth/

# 2. Logs, Dumps, & Local States (PREVENT PII OR INTERNAL TRACE LEAKS)
*.log
logs/
workflow-errors/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
core.*
*.dmp
*.crash

# 3. Proprietary Data & ML Models (PREVENT IP/DATA LEAKS)
data/
datasets/
models/
*.pt
*.pth
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.pkl
*.sqlite
*.db
*.csv
*.tsv

# 4. Caches & Build Artifacts (REDUCE NOISE & TOKEN USAGE)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage/
htmlcov/
node_modules/
build/
dist/
out/
.dart_tool/
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
*.class

# 5. OS & IDE Noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
